# Each scene is extracted into its own fresh process by the video launcher.
# Preparation precedes recording; actors then use ordinary native movement.
seed 73024
cheat god
set time 12 0
movable on
off: monstercharacter off
on: monstercharacter on
view clean 300
overlay off

# scene wolf_terrain
monstercharacter route wolf_terrain
wait 600
monstercharacter follow 350 130 90
rec wolf_terrain
monstercharacter begin
wait 12000
monstercharacter end
stop

